{"id":"04-filtros-css-para-imagenes","title":"04 Filtros CSS para imágenes","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":1,"words":119,"backlinks":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>La propiedad <code>filter</code> permite aplicar efectos visuales directamente a las imágenes o elementos web desde CSS, de manera similar a los filtros de un editor fotográfico. Nos permite ajustar desenfoques, brillos, contrastes, escala de grises o saturación de forma nativa.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Ejemplos de filtros individuales */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.imagen-desenfocada</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">blur</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">4px</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.imagen-gris</span>         { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">grayscale</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.imagen-brillante</span>    { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">brightness</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">140%</span>); }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.imagen-sombra</span>       { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">drop-shadow</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">4px</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">4px</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">8px</span> gray); }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Combinación de filtros y transiciones hover */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.galeria</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">img</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">220px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">12px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">grayscale</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">transition</span>: filter <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.3s</span> ease, transform <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.3s</span> ease;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.galeria</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">img</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-pseudo\">:hover</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Se pueden aplicar múltiples filtros separados por espacios */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">filter</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">grayscale</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0%</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">contrast</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">120%</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">brightness</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">110%</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">transform</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">scale</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.03</span>);\n}</code></pre></div>"}